  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Womens Essential Tank Top. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s Essential Collection, the Tank Top is crafted for everyday style and endless comfort while providing all-day versatility and functionality ideal for any wardrobe.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Womens Essential Tank Top. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s Essential Collection, the Tank Top is crafted for everyday style and endless comfort while providing all-day versatility and functionality ideal for any wardrobe. Unbelievable Comfort: Made from a special polyester / cotton blend, the womens tank top is silky-smooth and soft to the touch. For added comfort, the breathable tank top features flat seams at the collar and bottom hem, as well as a tag-less neck label. Comfortable and Easygoing: Designed with a crew neck, tapered waist, and curved hem, this sleeveless top sits just right, and is great for layering or as a standalone top. Versatile Everyday Top: From an active lifestyle consisting of working out, hiking, jogging, or going to the beach, to casual outings, family gatherings, or vacations, these comfortable tank tops complement a variety of styles. Complete the Look: Our Womens Essential Tank Top goes especially well with a pair of our Womens Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants or BDU Cargo Pants.</p>",
